menu "Sensor network"

    config SENSOR_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID (2.4 GHz)"
        default ""
        help
            Empty disables Wi-Fi and Modbus while the sensor keeps running.
            ESP32-S3 uses a 2.4 GHz network. Use a DHCP reservation for a stable IP.

    config SENSOR_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default ""
        help
            Empty selects an open network. Otherwise use a WPA2/WPA3-compatible
            password (8 to 63 characters or a 64-character hexadecimal PSK).
            This value is saved in sdkconfig and firmware; do not publish them.

endmenu
